  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "High-transfer experimental analogues sharing the dimethylaminoethyl and imide/aromatic-amine features consistently demonstrate BBB penetration and meaningful brain exposure across species, overriding the physicochemical prior of ionization and low logD.",
